  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 pound) whole chicken, cut into 6 pieces",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "1 (12 fluid ounce) can evaporated milk",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "2 teaspoons ground black pepper",
    "2 teaspoons garlic powder",
    "2 teaspoons onion powder",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 cups vegetable oil for frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix eggs and milk together in a medium bowl. Add almost all of the salt, pepper, garlic powder, and onion powder, reserving a dash of each for seasoning the chicken pieces. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pIafeLVkXgVf1aDlEsYbfrIwpVc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8802-tanyas-louisiana-southern-fried-chicken-Step-1-00082-d860cd892c814eab9bddcd6211ec64a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8802/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle a dash of the remaining salt, pepper, garlic powder and onion powder onto both sides of the chicken pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D5Z_h0GIZLoPQkGA1-ifk_a4zXw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8802-tanyas-louisiana-southern-fried-chicken-Step-2-00083-a6cd8a058c864b92a9145d7b8b841d6b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8802/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Place flour in a plastic bag. Dip chicken pieces, one at a time, into the egg and milk mixture, then transfer to the bag. Shake to coat each piece evenly with flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/re20HAeZtKbHsM9X28Br28EVT58=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8802-tanyas-louisiana-southern-fried-chicken-Step-3-00085-82619ceb6cb7416698508a116ce50227.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8802/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can check to see if the oil is hot enough by sprinkling a little flour in the skillet. If it fries, it's hot enough! Place the chicken pieces in the skillet. After about 5 minutes, turn the chicken over. Let chicken fry for about 15 minutes or until the meat is cooked through and the juices run clear.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tqoL2tVR4RDGH35IcuUkKxfec_0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8802-tanyas-louisiana-southern-fried-chicken-Step-4-00087-446e49369db6469d84749260048b062f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8802/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mbMXJV0w7n-XS9yufw_5bOQbR0o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8802-tanyas-louisiana-southern-fried-chicken-DDMFS-4x3-2c4d4c81a0124b758884506a7fdaa48c.jpg"
      ],
