    "description": "This top-rated family recipe is one of the best ways to make fried chicken at home. In this video, learn how to make Tanya’s Louisiana Southern Fried Chicken in just 30 minutes. First, prepare a simple seasoning with salt, pepper, garlic powder, and onion powder. Then, add the seasoning to eggs and evaporated milk. After seasoning a whole chicken (cut into six pieces), dip each piece into the batter, then into flour. Lastly, fry the prepared chicken in vegetable oil and serve with your favorite sides!",
